    "ORB -> chat scene: video bubble, revision typed and sent, AI reply with progress + check",
    "BARS -> face: 'Workflow' slams in on the right + 'editing'",
    "ORB -> stack scene: Tutorial dari nol / AI skill / Pakai sendiri glass cards flipping up",
